{"id":"789663ed3a5f1b82","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-fun-kernel-equivalence.md","title":"ZFC Fun Kernel Equivalence","display":"df-zfc-fun-kernel-equivalence — ZFC Fun Kernel Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-kernel-equivalence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-kernel-equivalence"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-kernel-equivalence — ZFC Fun Kernel Equivalence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-kernel-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-kernel-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-kernel-equivalence — ZFC Fun Kernel Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,E \\in V\">\\(f,E \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunKernelEquivalence}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunKernelEquivalence}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunKernelEquivalence}_S(E,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\times\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)=f(y)\\}\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,\\operatorname{dom}(f))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunKernelEquivalence}_S(E,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\times\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)=f(y)\\}\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,\\operatorname{dom}(f))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The kernel relation is defined only for a function and is explicitly certified as an equivalence relation on its domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751